  "solution_ref": "$\\frac{a_1}{b_2}=\\frac12$ → $b_2=4$, $b_n=2n$. $\\frac{a_n}{b_{n+1}}=n-\\frac12$ → $a_n=2(n+1)\\left(n-\\frac12\\right)=2n^2+n-1$ ($a_1=2$도 성립). $\\sum_{k=1}^5(2k^2+k-1)=110+15-5=120$",
